Dear Dr. {{referringPhysician}},

Re: {{patientName}}                    HC: {{patientHC}}

Mount Sinai Fertility has received this referral and would like to confirm whether the patient is actively trying to conceive.

If the patient is not actively attempting conception and the referral is solely for semen analysis, we regret to inform you that we are unable to accept this referral, as our clinic does not provide semen analysis services. In such cases, the patient may be directed to FlowLabs for further assistance.

Thank you for your understanding.

Sincerely,

{{signature}}

spermBanking.body:
{{currentDate}}

Dear Dr. {{referringPhysician}},

Re: {{patientName}}                    HC: {{patientHC}}

Mount Sinai Fertility has received this referral and would like to confirm whether the patient has any medical indication or an upcoming procedure that may impact fertility.

At present, our clinic offers sperm banking services only for patients with oncology diagnoses, those undergoing hormone replacement therapy (HRT), or individuals with other medical conditions or planned surgical interventions that may affect fertility. We do not offer sperm banking for non-medical or lifestyle purposes.

If the referral is for non-medical sperm banking, we kindly suggest redirecting the patient to ReproMed for further assistance.

Thank you for your understanding.

Sincerely,

{{signature}}

gyneReferral.body:
{{currentDate}}

Dear Dr. {{referringPhysician}},

Re: {{patientName}}                    HC: {{patientHC}}

Mount Sinai Fertility has received this referral and would like to confirm whether the patient is currently trying to conceive (TTC).

If the patient is not actively attempting conception, we would kindly recommend referral to a general gynecologist for further evaluation and management.

Please note that Mount Sinai Fertility provides services exclusively to patients who are actively trying to conceive. We do not accept routine gynecology referrals and only assess gynecological concerns when they are directly related to fertility in the context of active attempts to conceive.

Thank you for your understanding.

Sincerely,

{{signature}}

